      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Florham_Park%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Long before its borough status, the area was known as Broomtown, a nod to its historic broom‑making industry.",
